      "summary": "पुण्यात पती-पत्नीच्या वादातून गोळीबाराची घटना घडली असून पती जखमी झाला आहे. गोळी नेमकी कोणी झाडली, याबाबत पती-पत्नींकडून परस्पर आरोप करण्यात आले असून पोलिसांकडून तपास सुरू आहे.A shooting incident occurred in Pune following a dispute between a husband and wife, leaving the husband injured. The couple have made conflicting claims about who fired the shot, and police are investigating the incident. tiger maharashtra, marathi news live, news18 marathi, marathi baatmya, Monsoon session, Shivsena UBT MLA Meeting In Mumbai, MLC election, MLC counting, MLC results, Uddhav Thackeray, Devendra Fadnavis, Farm loan waiver, Mumbai water crisis, Watch News18 Marathi for- marathi news, marathi batmya, latest marathi, news, international news in marathi, live batmya, news in marathi language, news marathi latest, tajya batmya.News18 Marathi is one of the leading YouTube News channels which delivers news from across Maharashtra, India and the world 24x7 in Marathi. Stay updated on all the current events shaping Maharashtra's political landscape, with a special focus on key figures such as PM Narendra Modi, Amit Shah, Devendra Fadnavis, Ajit Pawar, Sharad Pawar, Eknath Shinde, Uddhav Thackeray, CMO Maharashtra, Aaditya Thackeray, Raj Thackeray, Manoj Jarange Patil, Prakash Ambedkar, and more.We cover interesting stories from across the world as well.Join us as we delve into the heart of Maharashtra Politics, providing comprehensive coverage and unbiased reporting on News18 Marathi's platform. Don't miss out on the action, subscribe now for all the latest news, debates, and more.Download our News18 Mobile App - https://onelink.to/desc-youtube",
